  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Monday 2 November 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nModern design, generous space and an excellent location come together in this beautifully presented, just two year old standalone home.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n• 5 generous bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms\r\n• Approx land area 197m2 and floor area 190m2\r\n• Two ensuites - one upstairs and one downstairs, ideal for extended families or guests\r\n• Separate upstairs study, perfect for working from home\r\n• Light-filled, open-plan living and dining\r\n• Contemporary kitchen with quality finishes\r\n• Practical layout offering space and privacy across both levels\r\n• Single garage with secure parking\r\n• Pleasant local outlook\r\n• Close to parks, shops and the Bucklands Beach waterfront\r\n• Excellent school zones – Macleans Primary, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College\r\n\r\nEnjoy the comfort of a near new home in an established East Auckland neighbourhood, with the added flexibility of an ensuite bedroom on each level and a dedicated study.\r\n\r\nA superb choice for growing families, multigenerational living or those seeking extra space.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing.",
